      "writtenOn": "2022-05-17T21:28:35Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I think ganesh works around this by special-casing t \u003c 0 and t \u003e 1 when clamping:\nhttps://crsrc.org/c/third_party/skia/src/gpu/ganesh/gradients/GrGradientShader.cpp;l\u003d563-566.",
      "parentUuid": "9aed00a2_2b8d799c",
